</mo><mn>16</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>y</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>±</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, the ellipse intercepts the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"210\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>-axis at the points <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"211\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mrow><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-s4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28 TEX-S4\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle space=\"3\"><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><